<div class="answer">
  <p class="lead" style="color: var(--ink)">A taxi or ride-hailing car from Cairo International Airport to the city centre should cost about <bdi>{{ taxi | priceText }}</bdi> (InEgypt estimate, checked {{ taxi.lastVerifiedAt | monthYear }}). Use the official taxi rank or a car booked in a ride-hailing app, agree the price or pricing method before you get in, and ignore anyone who offers a ride inside the terminal.</p>
