<h2>Step by step at arrivals</h2>
<ol>
  <li><b>Before you land,</b> save your hotel's address, ideally in Arabic too, so you can show it to the driver.</li>
  <li><b>Walk past offers inside the terminal.</b> People who approach you with a ride are not the official rank.</li>
  <li><b>Choose the official taxi rank or a ride-hailing app.</b> If you use an app, wait at the pickup point it shows.</li>
  <li><b>Confirm how the fare is worked out</b> before the car moves: the meter, the app fare, or the fixed price of a transfer service.</li>
  <li><b>Match the car and the plate</b> to the app, and keep the trip active in the app until you arrive.</li>
  <li><b>Show the address</b> and ask to go there directly, without stops at other hotels or shops.</li>
</ol>

