<h2>What InEgypt does and does not do here</h2>
<p>InEgypt does not book taxis or rides, and it has no live tracking of buses or cars. It shows the ways to get from the airport to your address, with time, changes and the fare for public transport, and the fair price for a taxi, so you know the number before anyone names one. The emergency page opens offline, for free.</p>

